<title>USA: PhoneTel extends Communications Central bid.</title>
<headline>PhoneTel extends Communications Central bid.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>PhoneTel Technologies Inc said Thursday that 97 percent of Communications Central Inc's outstanding shares had been tendered to it as of yesterday, and it has extended the tender offer to August 5.</p>
<p>PhoneTel said it is continuing its efforts to complete its financing for the transaction.</p>
<p>PhoneTel, based in Cleveland, is an independent public pay-telephone operator.</p>
</text>
